## About Me

I’m a Senior Hospitality Manager with hands-on experience managing large-scale hotel valet and parking operations.

My background is primarily operational, but over time I became increasingly interested in the financial side of the business — budgeting, labor management, variance analysis, revenue performance, and understanding how daily operating decisions affect the P&L.

This project grew out of that interest.

I wanted a framework that could take real hotel valet operating data and produce explanations that were financially accurate, operationally realistic, and easy to present to leadership.

I’m not an accountant, and this is not intended to replace formal accounting review. The goal is to bridge the gap between **operations and finance**.

