## Systems This Framework Is Based On

This project was built around a hotel valet environment using:

- **Opera** – hotel guest / room-based parking activity
- **Flash Parking** – valet and parking operations data
- Monthly financial / P&L reports
- Labor and payroll reporting
- Occupancy and vehicle forecasting

The exact setup may vary by property, but the underlying analysis can be adapted to other hotel valet operations with similar data sources.

