## Core Analysis Logic

The framework follows a managerial accounting approach:

```text
Planning Budget
        ↓
Actual Activity
        ↓
Expected Result at Actual Activity
        ↓
Actual Result
        ↓
Variance
        ↓
Operational Driver
        ↓
Management Interpretation
